           of some whimpy opponent? How does one pick something up, that one
           has dropped.

See online documentation. It is not _that_ hard. To open the gate use
the box with the button you find on your opponent.

                        How does one mount a horse.

In contrast to the commonly given answer this is possible.
Unfortunately I've forgotten how. Try talking to the horse and saying
one of the reasonable words to it.

                                                        Where can one find
           more dollars quickly? In the beginning one does not have 500au.

Go to the first building you see when entering rampart. This is the
bank. Open an account. Try to withdraw money. Give wrong password.
When asked to press space press return (or vice versa). This will give
you some starting money.

           how can one benifit from an oracle, buy either food or a map.

The oracle sends you on a series of quests. The first one (to go to
the druids retreat) is easy. The retreat is very close to rampart. A
few steps nnw, unless my memory deceives me. Then you get
progressively harder quests. Food and maps can be found in shops
around the city. It is often a good idea to try to enter all the
houses in the city first thing in the game. Then you know your way
around and can automatically go whereever you want later.

           how does one survive to gain expierience?

Fight (and win) many battles (main method). Or enter the cheat mode.
Go to the upper right corner of rampart and beat the corner of the
citywall there a few times. Then you have unlimited wishes.

